787
00:30:26,707 --> 00:30:27,707
Look at the basil plant.

788
00:30:27,708 --> 00:30:29,747
The soil must be nice there.

789
00:30:30,277 --> 00:30:31,547
It must be very fertile.

790
00:30:31,847 --> 00:30:33,587
Na Rae, you should plant your feet in the soil.

791
00:30:34,347 --> 00:30:35,617
Her feet will become this big.

792
00:30:35,887 --> 00:30:38,316
Her feet will become 310mm.

793
00:30:38,317 --> 00:30:39,357
For goodness' sake.

794
00:30:40,587 --> 00:30:42,856
Gosh, what's up with these eggplants?

795
00:30:42,857 --> 00:30:44,097
