831
00:32:22,345 --> 00:32:23,445
(Laughing)

832
00:32:25,445 --> 00:32:27,884
- You cook it like an eel. - An eel?

833
00:32:27,885 --> 00:32:29,684
Eggplants are soggy, right?

834
00:32:29,685 --> 00:32:30,714
- So, - It's a good idea.

835
00:32:30,715 --> 00:32:32,424
sprinkling starch on the top...

836
00:32:32,425 --> 00:32:34,085
makes it chewier and crunchier.

837
