Many people don't eat eggplants because of that.

838
00:32:36,195 --> 00:32:37,425
- That's right. - The soggy texture.

839
00:32:38,255 --> 00:32:40,495
(She makes it sticky.)

840
00:32:41,765 --> 00:32:45,665
Soy sauce, allulose, and tuna sauce.

841
00:32:46,565 --> 00:32:49,604
At the end, I add a bit of doubanjiang.

842
00:32:49,605 --> 00:32:51,405
You make rice with eggplant in a unique way.

843
00:32:52,645 --> 00:32:55,075
