844
00:32:55,345 --> 00:32:57,215
I put scrambled eggs over the rice.

845
00:32:57,445 --> 00:32:59,815
Then I top it with the eggplant. That's the rice with eggplant.

846
00:33:00,215 --> 00:33:02,315
The recipe is doable because it's simple.

847
00:33:03,855 --> 00:33:06,085
- It looks tasty. - It looks like rice with eel.

848
00:33:08,695 --> 00:33:09,854
