849
00:33:09,855 --> 00:33:10,855
It looks tasty.

850
00:33:12,825 --> 00:33:14,195
- My mom's young radish kimchi. - Young radish kimchi.

851
00:33:14,795 --> 00:33:16,395
It's nicely aged.

852
00:33:17,135 --> 00:33:18,634
Let's eat.

853
00:33:18,635 --> 00:33:20,435
