860
00:33:37,115 --> 00:33:38,485
I was surprised by how tasty it was.

861
00:33:41,585 --> 00:33:42,725
It's so tasty.

862
00:33:43,195 --> 00:33:44,325
It looks tasty.

863
00:33:44,455 --> 00:33:46,425
(Slurping)

864
00:33:47,125 --> 00:33:49,595
