875
00:34:13,855 --> 00:34:16,095
- Do you like ATEEZ? - I love ATEEZ.

876
00:34:16,325 --> 00:34:18,124
- Do you like ATEEZ? - I love ATEEZ.

877
00:34:18,125 --> 00:34:19,664
- Really? - You like ATEEZ.

878
00:34:19,665 --> 00:34:21,265
I've watched their videos so many times.

879
00:34:21,425 --> 00:34:22,564
I really want to go to the pre-recording.

880
00:34:22,565 --> 00:34:23,735
I want to go to their concert too.

881
00:34:25,235 --> 00:34:26,735
(Smiling)

882
00:34:27,805 --> 00:34:30,605
