883
00:34:31,975 --> 00:34:33,375
I want to go to the pre-recording.

884
00:34:35,005 --> 00:34:36,675
My bias is...

885
00:34:37,445 --> 00:34:40,014
- a team called ATEEZ. - ATEEZ.

886
00:34:40,015 --> 00:34:42,555
I like SAN so much.

887
00:34:42,915 --> 00:34:44,614
When he takes the stage,

888
00:34:44,615 --> 00:34:47,385
