889
00:34:48,185 --> 00:34:51,225
He has controlled charms.

890
00:34:51,695 --> 00:34:53,164
That video is my absolute favorite!

891
00:34:53,165 --> 00:34:54,365
How are his shoulders so broad?

892
00:34:55,125 --> 00:34:56,764
When you reach this age,

893
00:34:56,765 --> 00:35:00,465
