894
00:35:00,805 --> 00:35:03,405
There's only one thing I want from my darlings.

895
00:35:03,975 --> 00:35:06,844
- I want them to be happy. - "My darlings?"

896
00:35:06,845 --> 00:35:08,074
Aren't they about ten years younger than you?

897
00:35:08,075 --> 00:35:09,474
No, they're my darlings.

898
00:35:09,475 --> 00:35:10,715
