You sound like a soldier who is talking about a girl group.

900
00:35:13,285 --> 00:35:15,515
- All handsome men are darlings. - I agree.

901
00:35:17,455 --> 00:35:19,554
(Just as she loves her darlings,)

902
00:35:19,555 --> 00:35:21,755
