906
00:35:28,565 --> 00:35:30,335
- It must've been very tasty. - It was a huge eggplant.

907
00:35:30,495 --> 00:35:31,534
You should go to her place to get some eggplants.

908
00:35:31,535 --> 00:35:33,104
- I'd love to do that. - You should come.

909
00:35:33,105 --> 00:35:34,805
