- So, why do you want eggplants? - Why do you want eggplants?

914
00:35:41,975 --> 00:35:43,544
- You don't even cook. - That's right.

915
00:35:43,545 --> 00:35:44,975
- Why do you want them? - They'll be like souvenirs.

916
