- Souvenirs? - Souvenirs.

917
00:35:46,545 --> 00:35:47,714
They won't last.

918
00:35:47,715 --> 00:35:49,284
- Souvenirs from Na Rae. - You know,

919
00:35:49,285 --> 00:35:51,514
- that eggplant could be a souvenir. - Thank you.

920
00:35:51,515 --> 00:35:52,554
Use it for self-defense.

921
00:35:52,555 --> 00:35:53,884
- Self-defense. - Self-defense.

922
00:35:53,885 --> 00:35:55,185
(It's sturdy, so use it for self-defense.)

923
00:35:56,625 --> 00:35:58,124
(Instead of using it for self-defense,)

924
00:35:58,125 --> 00:35:59,595
(she enjoyed the eggplant.)

925
00:36:00,465 --> 00:36:02,935
