That's a tiramisu ingredient.

937
00:36:35,065 --> 00:36:36,395
Is that tiramisu?

938
00:36:36,665 --> 00:36:38,564
That cheese is a tiramisu ingredient.

939
00:36:38,565 --> 00:36:40,165
