940
00:36:41,305 --> 00:36:42,334
What?

941
00:36:42,335 --> 00:36:43,535
(Milk?)

942
00:36:44,605 --> 00:36:46,475
Gosh, I know what this is.

943
00:36:46,905 --> 00:36:48,105
Matcha latte?

944
00:36:48,745 --> 00:36:50,945
I've become obsessed with matcha.

945
00:36:51,975 --> 00:36:54,445
(Hue Park is also in love with it.)

946
