I use oat milk instead of milk.

952
00:37:09,035 --> 00:37:10,695
It's more savory.

953
00:37:11,135 --> 00:37:12,964
I feel like I'm eating tiramisu.

954
00:37:12,965 --> 00:37:14,365
However, it isn't greasy.

955
00:37:15,935 --> 00:37:17,334
Give me the recipe. How do you make it?

956
00:37:17,335 --> 00:37:19,004
- Oat milk. - Oat milk.

957
00:37:19,005 --> 00:37:21,144
Then in a matcha bowl...

958
00:37:21,145 --> 00:37:22,644
- You whisk matcha. - Yes.

959
00:37:22,645 --> 00:37:23,745
To that...

960
00:37:24,615 --> 00:37:25,745
Do you just mix it in?

961
00:37:26,045 --> 00:37:27,285
You create layers...

962
00:37:27,415 --> 00:37:29,215
- by pouring it in slowly. - You create layers.

963
00:37:29,415 --> 00:37:30,454
Just you wait.

964
00:37:30,455 --> 00:37:31,515
(This is how you give colors to each layer.)

965
00:37:31,815 --> 00:37:33,155
I'll aim for it.

966
00:37:33,755 --> 00:37:35,025
You'll aim for it?

967
00:37:36,055 --> 00:37:37,124
How pretty.

968
00:37:37,125 --> 00:37:38,495
(Attentive)

969
00:37:39,425 --> 00:37:41,525
