Back in the day, I didn't even wear pants.

985
00:38:24,905 --> 00:38:26,605
- I went outside that way. - Why did you forgo pants?

986
00:38:26,845 --> 00:38:29,715
That sounds nice. The weather is hot anyway.

987
00:38:30,145 --> 00:38:32,584
- Her clothes are very plain today. - They're plain.

988
00:38:32,585 --> 00:38:34,115
- You know... - To be honest, I was disappointed.

989
00:38:34,385 --> 00:38:36,154
- Now that I'm old... - Her outfit is very modest.

990
00:38:36,155 --> 00:38:37,754
Now that I'm old, I've changed.

991
00:38:37,755 --> 00:38:39,024
I thought you were going to the meeting of the parents.

992
00:38:39,025 --> 00:38:40,285
Seriously.

993
00:38:42,395 --> 00:38:44,555
(It's hard to tell where she's going from her outfit.)

994
00:38:47,365 --> 00:38:48,465
National Museum of Korea.

995
00:38:49,695 --> 00:38:50,894
National Museum of Korea.

996
00:38:50,895 --> 00:38:53,505
(Shelly Broom-to-be pays respect to the work of art.)

997
00:38:54,605 --> 00:38:56,134
It's like the National Museum of Korea.

998
00:38:56,135 --> 00:38:57,535
(It's a museum, not a house.)

999
00:38:58,905 --> 00:39:00,105
Her back is open.

1000
00:39:00,545 --> 00:39:02,675
My back looks nice. My back looks pretty.

1001
00:39:06,715 --> 00:39:07,814
It's Gyeongnidan-gil.

1002
00:39:07,815 --> 00:39:08,844
(She walks down Gyeongnidan-gil...)

1003
00:39:08,845 --> 00:39:10,815
(confidently.)

1004
00:39:11,385 --> 00:39:13,085
Today, my outfit was a bit ordinary.

1005
00:39:13,385 --> 00:39:14,785
But the back was the important part.

1006
00:39:15,225 --> 00:39:16,725
Jeans and a white T-shirt?

1007
00:39:16,955 --> 00:39:20,424
Ordinary outfits really don't suit me.

1008
00:39:20,425 --> 00:39:22,694
When I wear an outfit like that,

1009
