1024
00:39:57,295 --> 00:39:59,535
Seriously, I'm the same.

1025
00:39:59,635 --> 00:40:01,304
I don't wear a dress.

1026
00:40:01,305 --> 00:40:04,504
But even at home, I wear the clothes I like.

1027
00:40:04,505 --> 00:40:06,305
I don't focus solely on comfort.

1028
00:40:06,445 --> 00:40:07,704
"That's good" came after a pause.

1029
00:40:07,705 --> 00:40:09,415
(She gets a pass for relating to Na Rae.)

1030
00:40:12,845 --> 00:40:14,085
Na Rae!

1031
00:40:15,215 --> 00:40:16,514
Na Rae, we love you!

1032
00:40:16,515 --> 00:40:17,755
I love you too.

1033
00:40:18,215 --> 00:40:19,385
See you around.

1034
00:40:21,055 --> 00:40:22,725
People in Itaewon...

1035
